{"ts":"2026-04-16T15:49:36.581Z","session_id":1,"cmd":"note","args":{"positional":["POST-SCHOOL JECINDA DISTRICT unlocks: Just walk around, School, Park, Go home, Walk (foot travel - uses fitness?), Take the bus $5, Freeload on the bus (triggers securityBusIntro). Morning only showed School+Go home — schoolFlag/time gates unlock the district outside of class. \n\nBEN INTRO: scripted encounter on 'Go out' from school after PE on first day (Tuesday). Reward: +1 School Rep, +1 ben.relationship, -5 Energy. Ben is classmate being bullied by Kingsley. \n\nNPC object schema confirmed: X.relationship, X.metFlag at minimum (probably X.love, X.lust, X.trust based on the 13-17 keys per char).\n\nFULL DAY 1 PROGRESSION RECIPE: Tuesday - wake, change to SchoolUni, travel (Home→LivRoom→Jecinda 10min+→School 10min = 20 min), attend 4 classes 9-1pm (Art, Science, CS, PE), lunch break at 11am for Canteen, after-school hub opens Library+Canteen+WC+Go out. Ben intro triggers on exit. Park + bus travel unlocks after school."]},"ok":true}
